{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-27T12:11:59.163Z","author":"glm-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"0147a6b2b1c7f6eaade00ba3","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:11:59.162Z","author":"glm-agent","text":"Decision update (owner-directed): instead of waiting for the upstream fix to unbraind/pm-cli#1609, this branch ships a package-side bounded retry for dead-owner lock conflicts. Acceptance: (1) every ledger SDK mutation treats lock_conflict with reason lock_owner_dead as retryable with bounded backoff and jitter, total budget 15s configurable through ledger options; live-owner lock_conflict still fails fast with the typed error. (2) The SIGKILL root-write test stays strict (previous budget/transcript intact AND next writer succeeds); add a live-owner fails-fast test and a bounded-budget test (permanently dead owner fails with the typed error after the budget, never hangs). (3) README storage/recovery note citing pm-cli#1609, removable once upstream ships. (4) Changelog regenerated the repo's way. Prefer the SDK lock-wait option over a hand-rolled loop if the pinned SDK exposes one."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-27T12:11:59.163Z"}],"before_hash":"9732213f5c81a06927192c9e8afd1bdb3f38d420c7f1cbf92e746f1c97a37f38","after_hash":"4063de0b3e2e100694eed00e6d7d8805e009d8fd201a8e1f360d3e5d96716097","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"0100cdd2ff92e312679478f65d24b868fbc892cafb6eedf8dd6338bb98165646"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-27T12:12:05.721Z","author":"glm-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"0147a6b2b1c7f6eaade00ba3","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-27T12:12:05.721Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags/0","value":"gh:unbraind/pm-cli#1609"}],"before_hash":"4063de0b3e2e100694eed00e6d7d8805e009d8fd201a8e1f360d3e5d96716097","after_hash":"d5397b240cfa71d48186f67bba8367004b8ed283a44b8a3b2c0a5153f998707d","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e11f9a46d904428c873300c9be2a343e7b7533acd04b6e8846845dcc5bc0ced0"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-27T12:40:12.725Z","author":"glm-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"0147a6b2b1c7f6eaade00ba3","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:40:12.725Z","author":"glm-agent","text":"Revert proof (behavioural): with only the retry wrapper reverted (RlmLedger.mutate made a passthrough, no other change), the new bounded-budget regression test fails with 'The retry budget must be spent before failing' because the permanently fenced dead-owner lock surfaces the SDK lock_conflict immediately. The pre-fix SIGKILL root-write failure is the red main run (lock_conflict lock_owner_dead after waiting 3002ms from RlmLedger.complete). Timing note: locally the SIGKILL root test can pass even without the retry because the post-kill checkpoint read is slow enough under host load that the commit-fence gate is already within its ten-second expiry window when resume starts, so the SDK's internal three-second wait reaches the takeover; CI's faster gap is what failed. The new tests pin the semantics deterministically regardless of that gap."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-27T12:40:12.725Z"}],"before_hash":"d5397b240cfa71d48186f67bba8367004b8ed283a44b8a3b2c0a5153f998707d","after_hash":"8be9322e171a6eee99826a08b71e5c33ee0c3cfdde0e53a79b3158e1a3e040b1","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"97b26621a28652dd8e7d10109de5a69b714cfebbb2690d13a7361678ba1016d4"}
